repository-code: https://github.com/kayting4000/PhotoSync
abstract: >
  PhotoSync is a full-stack academic management system for scanning test papers,
  tracking student grades, and distributing results via email. It includes a
  Next.js web frontend, a Python FastAPI backend, and a Flutter mobile app.
keywords:
  - education
  - grade management
  - computer vision
  - flutter
  - fastapi
  - nextjs
